{"id":"732192547701a95da9bcb9eee7ffe5a35b076c3c","axis":"silent","repo":"systemd/systemd","sha":"732192547701a95da9bcb9eee7ffe5a35b076c3c","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"NEWS","lines":["@@ -266,6 +266,15 @@ CHANGES WITH 263 in spe:","           via polkit that the client is authorized for the specified action","           before the connection is upgraded and the command is executed."," ","+        * New optional varlink-sftp-root.socket and varlink-sftp-root-ro.socket","+          units expose the local file system via SFTP over an upgraded Varlink","+          connection, read-write and read-only respectively. Access is","+          controlled via the polkit actions io.systemd.sftp.root and","+          io.systemd.sftp.root-read-only. They are built only with","+          -Dvarlink-sftp=true, and are disabled by default. Note that both","+          run as root so allowing access is equivalent to r/w root access or","+          r/o /etc/shadow access.","+"," CHANGES WITH 262:"," ","         Announcements of Future Feature Removals and Incompatible Changes:"],"additions":9,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"meson.build","lines":["@@ -785,19 +785,20 @@ ln_s = ln.full_path() + ' -frsT -- \"${DESTDIR:-}@0@\" \"${DESTDIR:-}@1@\"'"," # If -Dxxx-path option is found, use that. Otherwise, use the default from the"," # middle column; a full path is used directly, a relative path is converted to"," # /usr/bin/foo or /usr/sbin/foo, depending on whether split-bin is enabled.","-progs = [['quotaon',    'quotaon'              ],","-         ['quotacheck', 'quotacheck'           ],","-         ['kmod',       '/usr/bin/kmod'        ],","-         ['kexec',      'kexec'                ],","-         ['sulogin',    'sulogin'              ],","-         ['swapon',     'swapon'               ],","-         ['swapoff',    'swapoff'              ],","-         ['agetty',     'agetty'               ],","-         ['mount',      '/usr/bin/mount',      'MOUNT_PATH'],","-         ['umount',     '/usr/bin/umount',     'UMOUNT_PATH'],","-         ['loadkeys',   '/usr/bin/loadkeys',   'KBD_LOADKEYS'],","-         ['setfont',    '/usr/bin/setfont',    'KBD_SETFONT'],","-         ['nologin',    'nologin',             ],","+progs = [['quotaon',     'quotaon'                           ],","+         ['quotacheck',  'quotacheck'                        ],","+         ['kmod',        '/usr/bin/kmod'                     ],","+         ['kexec',       'kexec'                             ],","+         ['sulogin',     'sulogin'                           ],","+         ['swapon',      'swapon'                            ],","+         ['swapoff',     'swapoff'                           ],","+         ['agetty',      'agetty'                            ],","+         ['mount',       '/usr/bin/mount',                   'MOUNT_PATH'],","+         ['umount',      '/usr/bin/umount',                  'UMOUNT_PATH'],","+         ['loadkeys',    '/usr/bin/loadkeys',                'KBD_LOADKEYS'],","+         ['setfont',     '/usr/bin/setfont',                 'KBD_SETFONT'],","+         ['nologin',     'nologin'                           ],","+         ['sftp-server', '/usr/libexec/openssh/sftp-server', 'SFTP_SERVER'],","         ]"," foreach prog : progs","         path = get_option(prog[0] + '-path')","@@ -1862,6 +1863,7 @@ foreach tuple : [","                 ['utmp',            get_option('libc') != 'musl', 'musl does not support it'],","                 ['userdb'],","                 ['varlink-monitord'],","+                ['varlink-sftp'],","                 ['vconsole'],","                 ['xdg-autostart'],","         ]"],"additions":15,"deletions":13,"truncated":false},{"path":"meson_options.txt","lines":["@@ -63,6 +63,7 @@ option('nologin-path', type : 'string', description : 'path to nologin')"," option('quotacheck-path', type : 'string', description : 'path to quotacheck')"," option('quotaon-path', type : 'string', description : 'path to quotaon')"," option('setfont-path', type : 'string', description : 'path to setfont')","+option('sftp-server-path', type : 'string', description : 'path to the SFTP server binary')"," option('sulogin-path', type : 'string', description : 'path to sulogin')"," option('swapoff-path', type : 'string', description : 'path to swapoff')"," option('swapon-path', type : 'string', description : 'path to swapon')","@@ -286,6 +287,8 @@ option('validatefs', type : 'feature',","        description : 'install systemd-validatefs and associated files')"," option('varlink-monitord', type : 'boolean',","        description : 'install the systemd-varlink-monitord daemon')","+option('varlink-sftp', type : 'boolean', value : false,","+       description : 'install the varlink-sftp sockets and services')"," option('vconsole', type : 'boolean',","        description : 'support for vconsole configuration')"," option('veritysetup', type : 'feature',"],"additions":3,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"mkosi/mkosi.functions","lines":["@@ -24,7 +24,7 @@ if ((LLVM)) && [[ -n \"$SANITIZERS\" ]]; then","     MKOSI_RUSTFLAGS=\"-Clink-arg=-shared-libasan -Clink-arg=-Wl,-rpath=$(realpath \"$(clang --print-runtime-dir)\")\""," fi"," ","-MKOSI_MESON_OPTIONS=\"-D mode=developer -D vcs-tag=${VCS_TAG:-true} -D b_sanitize=${SANITIZERS:-none} -Dtime-epoch=1744207869\"","+MKOSI_MESON_OPTIONS=\"-D mode=developer -D vcs-tag=${VCS_TAG:-true} -D b_sanitize=${SANITIZERS:-none} -Dtime-epoch=1744207869 -D varlink-sftp=true\""," if ((WIPE)) && [[ -d \"$BUILDDIR/meson-private\" ]]; then","     MKOSI_MESON_OPTIONS=\"$MKOSI_MESON_OPTIONS --wipe\""," fi"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"presets/90-systemd.preset","lines":["@@ -78,3 +78,6 @@ disable systemd-journal-remote.*"," disable systemd-journal-upload.*"," disable systemd-sysext-sysroot.service"," disable systemd-time-wait-sync.service","+","+disable varlink-sftp-root.*","+disable varlink-sftp-root-ro.*"],"additions":3,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/varlinkctl/io.systemd.sftp.policy","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,40 @@","+<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?> <!--*-nxml-*-->","+<!DOCTYPE policyconfig PUBLIC \"-//freedesktop//DTD PolicyKit Policy Configuration 1.0//EN\"","+        \"https://www.freedesktop.org/standards/PolicyKit/1/policyconfig.dtd\">","+","+<!--","+  SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later","+","+  This file is part of systemd.","+","+  systemd is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it","+  under the terms of the GNU Lesser General Public License as published by","+  the Free Software Foundation; either version 2.1 of the License, or","+  (at your option) any later version.","+-->","+","+<policyconfig>","+","+        <vendor>The systemd Project</vendor>","+        <vendor_url>https://systemd.io</vendor_url>","+","+        <action id=\"io.systemd.sftp.root\">","+                <description gettext-domain=\"systemd\">Access the local file system via SFTP</description>","+                <message gettext-domain=\"systemd\">Authentication is required to access the local file system via SFTP with full root privileges.</message>","+                <defaults>","+                        <allow_any>auth_admin</allow_any>","+                        <allow_inactive>auth_admin</allow_inactive>","+                        <allow_active>auth_admin</allow_active>","+                </defaults>","+        </action>","+","+        <action id=\"io.systemd.sftp.root-read-only\">","+                <description gettext-domain=\"systemd\">Read the local file system via SFTP</description>","+                <message gettext-domain=\"systemd\">Authentication is required to read the local file system via SFTP with root privileges. This allows reading any file, including secrets such as /etc/shadow.</message>","+                <defaults>","+                        <allow_any>auth_admin</allow_any>","+                        <allow_inactive>auth_admin</allow_inactive>","+                        <allow_active>auth_admin</allow_active>","+                </defaults>","+        </action>","+</policyconfig>"],"additions":40,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/varlinkctl/meson.build","lines":["@@ -15,3 +15,8 @@ executables += ["," ]"," "," install_emptydir(varlinkbridgesdir)","+","+if conf.get('ENABLE_VARLINK_SFTP') == 1","+        install_data('io.systemd.sftp.policy',","+                     install_dir : polkitpolicydir)","+endif"],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"test/units/TEST-74-AUX-UTILS.varlink-sftp.sh","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,73 @@","+#!/usr/bin/env bash","+# SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later","+set -eux","+set -o pipefail","+","+SFTP_SERVER=\"$(systemctl cat varlink-sftp-root.service 2>/dev/null | sed -n 's/^ConditionPathExists=//p')\" || :","+if [[ ! -x \"$SFTP_SERVER\" ]] || ! command -v sftp >/dev/null; then","+    echo \"sftp-server or sftp not available, skipping.\" >&2","+    exit 77","+fi","+","+TMPDIR_SFTP=\"$(mktemp -d)\"","+","+at_exit() {","+    set +e","+    systemctl stop varlink-sftp-root.socket varlink-sftp-root-ro.socket varlink-sftp-root.service varlink-sftp-root-ro.service","+    if [[ -e /etc/polkit-1/rules.d/varlink-sftp-test.rules ]]; then","+        rm -f /etc/polkit-1/rules.d/varlink-sftp-test.rules","+        systemctl try-reload-or-restart polkit.service","+    fi","+    rm -rf \"$TMPDIR_SFTP\"","+}","+trap at_exit EXIT","+","+sftp_varlink() {","+    sftp -b - -D \"varlinkctl call --upgrade /run/varlink/registry/$1 $1.Connect\"","+}","+","+sftp_varlink_testuser() {","+    run0 --pipe -u testuser sftp -b - -D \"varlinkctl call --upgrade /run/varlink/registry/$1 $1.Connect\"","+}","+","+systemctl start varlink-sftp-root.socket varlink-sftp-root-ro.socket","+chmod 755 \"$TMPDIR_SFTP\"","+echo hello >\"$TMPDIR_SFTP/src\"","+","+# Without a polkit rule an unprivileged user is denied on both endpoints","+(! sftp_varlink_testuser io.systemd.Sftp.RootReadOnly <<<\"get $TMPDIR_SFTP/src /tmp/varlink-sftp-denied\")","+test ! -e /tmp/varlink-sftp-denied","+","+# Grant testuser read-only access only and verify the two actions are enforced independently.","+# Varlink polkit checks only send a pidfd subject, which needs kernel >= 6.5 and polkit >= 124.","+if [[ -f /usr/share/dbus-1/system-services/org.freedesktop.PolicyKit1.service ]] &&","+   [[ -f /usr/share/polkit-1/actions/io.systemd.sftp.policy ]] &&","+   systemd-analyze compare-versions \"$(uname -r)\" ge 6.5 &&","+   systemd-analyze compare-versions \"$(pkcheck --version | awk '{print $3}')\" ge 124; then","+    mkdir -p /etc/polkit-1/rules.d","+    cat >/etc/polkit-1/rules.d/varlink-sftp-test.rules <<'EOF2'","+polkit.addRule(function(action, subject) {","+    if (action.id == \"io.systemd.sftp.root-read-only\" && subject.user == \"testuser\") {","+        return polkit.Result.YES;","+    }","+});","+EOF2","+    systemctl try-reload-or-restart polkit.service","+","+    sftp_varlink_testuser io.systemd.Sftp.RootReadOnly <<<\"get $TMPDIR_SFTP/src /tmp/varlink-sftp-testuser-get\"","+    cmp \"$TMPDIR_SFTP/src\" /tmp/varlink-sftp-testuser-get","+    rm -f /tmp/varlink-sftp-testuser-get","+    (! sftp_varlink_testuser io.systemd.Sftp.Root <<<\"put $TMPDIR_SFTP/src $TMPDIR_SFTP/testuser-rw\")","+    test ! -e \"$TMPDIR_SFTP/testuser-rw\"","+","+    rm -f /etc/polkit-1/rules.d/varlink-sftp-test.rules","+    systemctl try-reload-or-restart polkit.service","+fi","+","+(! sftp_varlink io.systemd.Sftp.RootReadOnly <<<\"put $TMPDIR_SFTP/src $TMPDIR_SFTP/ro\")","+test ! -e \"$TMPDIR_SFTP/ro\"","+sftp_varlink io.systemd.Sftp.RootReadOnly <<<\"get $TMPDIR_SFTP/src $TMPDIR_SFTP/ro-get\"","+cmp \"$TMPDIR_SFTP/src\" \"$TMPDIR_SFTP/ro-get\"","+","+sftp_varlink io.systemd.Sftp.Root <<<\"put $TMPDIR_SFTP/src $TMPDIR_SFTP/rw\"","+cmp \"$TMPDIR_SFTP/src\" \"$TMPDIR_SFTP/rw\""],"additions":73,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"units/meson.build","lines":["@@ -1203,6 +1203,22 @@ units = [","           'conditions' : ['ENABLE_MACHINED'],","           'symlinks' : ['remote-fs.target.wants/', 'machines.target.wants/'],","         },","+        {","+          'file' : 'varlink-sftp-root.service.in',","+          'conditions' : ['ENABLE_VARLINK_SFTP'],","+        },","+        {","+          'file' : 'varlink-sftp-root.socket.in',","+          'conditions' : ['ENABLE_VARLINK_SFTP'],","+        },","+        {","+          'file' : 'varlink-sftp-root-ro.service.in',","+          'conditions' : ['ENABLE_VARLINK_SFTP'],","+        },","+        {","+          'file' : 'varlink-sftp-root-ro.socket.in',","+          'conditions' : ['ENABLE_VARLINK_SFTP'],","+        },","         {","           'file' : 'veritysetup-pre.target',","           'conditions' : ['ENABLE_VERITYSETUP'],"],"additions":16,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"units/varlink-sftp-root-ro.service.in","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,42 @@","+#  SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later","+#","+#  This file is part of systemd.","+#","+#  systemd is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it","+#  under the terms of the GNU Lesser General Public License as published by","+#  the Free Software Foundation; either version 2.1 of the License, or","+#  (at your option) any later version.","+","+[Unit]","+Description=Varlink SFTP Server (root, read-only)","+Documentation=man:varlinkctl(1)","+Requires=varlink-sftp-root-ro.socket","+ConditionPathExists={{SFTP_SERVER}}","+","+[Service]","+Type=notify","+# -R places sftp-server in read-only mode","+# -e makes it log to stderr (which ends up in the journal)","+ExecStart=varlinkctl serve --polkit-action=io.systemd.sftp.root-read-only io.systemd.Sftp.RootReadOnly.Connect -- {{SFTP_SERVER}} -e -R","+","+# Avoid settings that hide parts of the file system (PrivateDevices=,","+# ProtectProc=, ...) so both flavours export the same view.","+NoNewPrivileges=yes","+PrivateNetwork=yes","+RestrictAddressFamilies=AF_UNIX","+RestrictNamespaces=yes","+RestrictRealtime=yes","+LockPersonality=yes","+MemoryDenyWriteExecute=yes","+SystemCallArchitectures=native","+TasksMax=64","+# While -R already denies writes we still enforce it (because we can).","+ProtectSystem=strict","+ProtectHome=read-only","+RestrictSUIDSGID=yes","+SystemCallFilter=@system-service","+SystemCallFilter=~@privileged @resources","+SystemCallErrorNumber=EPERM","+","+[Install]","+Also=varlink-sftp-root-ro.socket"],"additions":42,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"units/varlink-sftp-root-ro.socket.in","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@","+#  SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later","+#","+#  This file is part of systemd.","+#","+#  systemd is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it","+#  under the terms of the GNU Lesser General Public License as published by","+#  the Free Software Foundation; either version 2.1 of the License, or","+#  (at your option) any later version.","+","+[Unit]","+Description=Varlink SFTP Server Socket (root, read-only)","+Documentation=man:varlinkctl(1)","+ConditionPathExists={{SFTP_SERVER}}","+","+[Socket]","+ListenStream=/run/systemd/io.systemd.Sftp.RootReadOnly","+Symlinks=/run/varlink/registry/io.systemd.Sftp.RootReadOnly","+SocketMode=0666","+RemoveOnStop=yes","+XAttrEntryPoint=user.varlink=entrypoint","+XAttrListen=user.varlink=listen","+","+[Install]","+WantedBy=sockets.target"],"additions":24,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"units/varlink-sftp-root.service.in","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@","+#  SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later","+#","+#  This file is part of systemd.","+#","+#  systemd is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it","+#  under the terms of the GNU Lesser General Public License as published by","+#  the Free Software Foundation; either version 2.1 of the License, or","+#  (at your option) any later version.","+","+[Unit]","+Description=Varlink SFTP Server (root, read-write)","+Documentation=man:varlinkctl(1)","+Requires=varlink-sftp-root.socket","+ConditionPathExists={{SFTP_SERVER}}","+","+[Service]","+Type=notify","+# -e makes it log to stderr (which ends up in the journal)","+ExecStart=varlinkctl serve --polkit-action=io.systemd.sftp.root io.systemd.Sftp.Root.Connect -- {{SFTP_SERVER}} -e","+","+NoNewPrivileges=yes","+PrivateNetwork=yes","+RestrictAddressFamilies=AF_UNIX","+RestrictNamespaces=yes","+RestrictRealtime=yes","+LockPersonality=yes","+MemoryDenyWriteExecute=yes","+SystemCallArchitectures=native","+TasksMax=64","+","+[Install]","+Also=varlink-sftp-root.socket"],"additions":32,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"units/varlink-sftp-root.socket.in","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@","+#  SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later","+#","+#  This file is part of systemd.","+#","+#  systemd is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it","+#  under the terms of the GNU Lesser General Public License as published by","+#  the Free Software Foundation; either version 2.1 of the License, or","+#  (at your option) any later version.","+","+[Unit]","+Description=Varlink SFTP Server Socket (root, read-write)","+Documentation=man:varlinkctl(1)","+ConditionPathExists={{SFTP_SERVER}}","+","+[Socket]","+ListenStream=/run/systemd/io.systemd.Sftp.Root","+Symlinks=/run/varlink/registry/io.systemd.Sftp.Root","+SocketMode=0666","+RemoveOnStop=yes","+XAttrEntryPoint=user.varlink=entrypoint","+XAttrListen=user.varlink=listen","+","+[Install]","+WantedBy=sockets.target",""],"additions":24,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":287,"deletions":14,"truncated":false,"file_count":13},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-10-31T14:37:03.645227+00:00"}